			],
			"Message": "docs(Mist): Update component table and add WebSocket module documentation\n\nRefactor the components section in README.md from a bulleted list to a markdown table for improved readability. Update the content to strictly follow PascalCase naming conventions for all file references (e.g., `lib.rs` -> `lib.rs`, `server.rs` -> `Server.rs`, `zone.rs` -> `Zone.rs`).\n\nInclude the previously missing `WebSocket.rs` component to document the real-time DNS data streaming layer. Ensure technical terms like `API`, `UDP`, `TCP`, and `Hickory` are consistently capitalized.\n\nThis aligns the documentation with the project's PascalCase standards and accurately reflects the current public API surface of the Mist crate.",
